          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ece8e81ad8bca9c43903ca1f8be7df36ab5886a923ec302ac5629a25415b2374:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_3f9745e46c364369af4f77ebd89698e2",
      "statement": "locateProjectRoot identifies the project root as the first directory containing web/WEB-INF/web.xml, searching up to four parents of the JVM working directory and then up to six parents of StartJetty's own code-source location; main separately aborts with IllegalStateException when that descriptor is missing.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/StartJetty.java#L124-L143",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:9fccd12aa27f9cd3c2413e93fe77f6e17a43bceb08f6291f459d441d4c1446cb:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/StartJetty.java#L56-L62",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:aca26f5310dfb50a0aba02ff2efa1cc9855b33cbde3390b71e4950cbe39d2295:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_2ad5c07d1fd645e79a1042a7cd661aeb",
      "statement": "ensureCompiledClasses compiles every .java file found under src/ into web/WEB-INF/classes with UTF-8 encoding and -source/-target 8 (Java 8 bytecode on any launch JDK), on a classpath composed of all web/WEB-INF/lib jars plus that output directory, and recompiles every source on every launch instead of comparing timestamps.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/StartJetty.java#L145-L186",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e8c08299ab6c1d619003e4a28758dfc78934b1f75c2bb4cbe08250f906741f70:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/StartJetty.java#L165-L171",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:b5b75a623ce22bca68cccb100e90bbd589503caf21bda267d2868a9fdb16931e:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_723ec6b9341a40e6884dbee63662cc90",
      "statement": "A compilation error aborts the launch before any server exists: the in-code diagnostic listener prints only Diagnostic.Kind.ERROR entries and a failed compilation task raises IllegalStateException, so Jetty is never started against a partially compiled src tree.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/StartJetty.java#L174-L183",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:513504b0bd0f519cbabdd2aac4dda85a06c067cf3a4b2b21d56e80fc9bfe5b17:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/StartJetty.java#L64-L64",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ce27d0824d75f242c4518be2699f1299231342c02ec17f5a337e12f95d43650d:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b59c12f70e7a498fbec1c73cd93f16f2",
      "statement": "When no system Java compiler is available (a JRE), the launcher skips compilation and resource synchronization and runs against whatever is already present in web/WEB-INF/classes; an empty set of .java files also returns early and skips the resource sync.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/StartJetty.java#L153-L162",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:779c65ba41c9b2f8523377ee05e4c1596f6a4b4b77f3366959711289551008b6:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_34a8680b463142c0917891a6942a6e4c",
      "statement": "syncResources copies every non-.java regular file of src/ into web/WEB-INF/classes preserving its relative path, but only when the target is missing or older than the source, which is what makes classpath:applicationContext.xml, classpath:struts.xml, classpath:sql/tmall_ssh_h2.sql and log4j2.xml resolvable at runtime.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/StartJetty.java#L188-L206",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ad23c00f0d88fdcd21d769a6acf6c608f8cd67e88b78ee70a2e51f21fb8e6164:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/applicationContext.xml#L37-L41",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:def27cc1bf4b701ad65e14801b71bb715ab2148a9f090e599bb445ce8c65f194:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_bc465072dccf4dc4a8d9b7974e39bff2",
      "statement": "The launcher never deletes output: a source file removed from src/ leaves its .class file and copied resources in web/WEB-INF/classes until that directory is cleaned by hand, while the directory itself is generated, disposable and git-ignored.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://.gitignore#L1-L2",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c4961ba5731635074348a8f2bb85e8aae0257ee3a60bf1dae9d0185f6c112afd:"
