    },
    {
      "id": "claim_f09bbe2fec9b4b008615ab2a5d3b3e4a",
      "statement": "The web application is deployed through nested handlers: a WebAppContext with context path \"/\", resource base web/ and descriptor web/WEB-INF/web.xml becomes the handler of a RewriteHandler which is itself the server's handler, so the original descriptor is used verbatim and web/ is the single source of JSPs, static assets and WEB-INF.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/StartJetty.java#L103-L104",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:5c914f5c5a522ba2fad55a13e25b0da22210ccb61bb878bc50be95f0f5504c61:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/StartJetty.java#L66-L70",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c57846edfee7b9a60d4f8336f6f5d2cd52f4371cde5dd92865ea65b3c694ce81:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://web/WEB-INF/web.xml#L6-L39",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:08955ce474039ad7fcf5d67843f6a96362f80a9275811939827b5a8068505e33:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b2615571f5914321b2a9b0f9ecbec6d2",
      "statement": "web/WEB-INF/web.xml declares only two /* filters (the Struts2 dispatcher and Spring's CharacterEncodingFilter), a contextConfigLocation context-param and the ContextLoaderListener, and no servlet at all; consequently JSP and static-file serving come from Jetty's own defaults, and the entire Spring context refresh, including the seed script executed by dbInit, happens inside server.start().",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/StartJetty.java#L110-L110",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e1c8a16f9fe48a7cd9ac9a7d3be2aa4258030140093e061a0bbf980393ad295d:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/applicationContext.xml#L29-L44",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:eba29ce9057be2413e00fd00d089d483c780c9dbd64c4be66c0d1c77aac9706c:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://web/WEB-INF/web.xml#L6-L39",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:08955ce474039ad7fcf5d67843f6a96362f80a9275811939827b5a8068505e33:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_b62ddabb1dd64e809bd84f25f563a0e0",
      "statement": "Because every dependency jar is simultaneously on the JVM classpath and inside web/WEB-INF/lib, the launcher pins seven package prefixes to the parent loader with addSystemClass (log4j, h2, juli, jasper, el, javax.servlet.jsp and Jetty's Jasper glue); removing those pins reintroduces duplicate class definitions whose documented symptoms are ServiceConfigurationError, a webapp-level TldCache ClassCastException and an in-memory H2 database that the console can no longer see.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://MIGRATION.md#L34-L34",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:40d9a563ced922e643402ea96c21153cec699e332c474acfe33fd7aff49151fb:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://STARTUP.md#L83-L83",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:adc4d5de9ba94457fc3ef7c337694f46de164fdf36cdbd2d36b5e7c7fb7e10b7:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/StartJetty.java#L71-L81",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:31ca7ff965170db94362933455fd2e0aaa1a0d093d55945399e282ee8404fb36:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_479452c9c6c840d29652f1f306669853",
      "statement": "The launcher writes the Jetty Configuration chain out explicitly because the embedded default chain omits AnnotationConfiguration; without it the ServletContainerInitializers discovered from the webapp jars never run, so the JSP engine's JasperInitializer does not install the shared TldCache and JSP compilation fails with getTldCache() is null.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://MIGRATION.md#L31-L31",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:91d32275cd2e1a1a6fe57455cc8d39a4c8c282ffad6a01d271cfc37214dbefcf:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/StartJetty.java#L83-L88",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:328d3fdd3f67e58effb3f8875e51b319366f82a0a9cf7e2c9a5403d10942c18f:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1342537604274e63a1192e65d94bcc5a",
      "statement": "The root path is served by a RewriteHandler rule that returns /forehome only for the exact target \"/\" and null for everything else; the built-in RewritePatternRule was rejected because its pattern has regex/prefix semantics, under which a pattern of \"/\" would rewrite every path including /img/** to /forehome and turn site images into HTML.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://MIGRATION.md#L33-L33",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:07a2ebd7b51da7e35978d7d8e7c3a71def4c28ca8672533cd394deae2b32b027:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/StartJetty.java#L90-L104",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:dae4051fed32b4be268e44b1aa5fcaa72f2008f3591acfc2167c4e74b10d09fb:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7b89104a86e640af913a0ee1276b0319",
      "statement": "The rewrite rule is only correct while CONTEXT_PATH is \"/\": the RewriteHandler sits outside the WebAppContext, so under a non-root context path the incoming request target would carry the context prefix, the exact match on \"/\" would never fire, and the root URL would stop resolving.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/StartJetty.java#L49-L51",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:ece8e81ad8bca9c43903ca1f8be7df36ab5886a923ec302ac5629a25415b2374:"
        },
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/StartJetty.java#L95-L104",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:56565a29faed7b64f50f953215281e6556c88a80346fb07a5249b4dccb8b38d2:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_ba97d975ff1944cab04b8af30ec5d82a",
      "statement": "web/index.jsp contains its own response.sendRedirect(\"/forehome\") but is only reachable when explicitly requested as /index.jsp, because a request for the root path is rewritten before it can reach the page.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/StartJetty.java#L95-L102",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:e7ccf46fd6522e38479d4ef725cac5d8e63cb6adc8b917cd2021286be426483e:"
