    },
    {
      "id": "claim_eed67d6b2ed44563aa75a771df262b10",
      "statement": "The console can attach to the running application's data because the datasource URL carries DB_CLOSE_DELAY=-1 (the in-memory database lives as long as the JVM) and because org.h2 is pinned to the parent loader, so console and webapp share one JVM-local database instance.",
      "evidence": [
