    {
      "id": "claim_3b58b1455efe4b80aeb2fecad23f04d1",
      "statement": "The success banner listing the storefront, admin and console URLs is printed only after server.start() returns, so a taken port (BindException) or a failed source compilation shows no banner, while the container's context deployment and Spring refresh happen earlier inside server.start().",
      "evidence": [
