    {
      "id": "claim_df08227e62a94b38ae96a1fcade6fdb3",
      "statement": "The launcher has no automated test: the only test class loads the Spring context and never starts Jetty, so verification is the manual smoke path of banner plus /, /img/site/logo.gif (proving the rewrite stayed narrow), /forehome, /admin_category_list and the console on 8082.",
